  "title": "Nigeria confirms first Ebola case as outbreak spreads into western Africa",
  "summary": "Nigeria confirms its first-ever Ebola case as the virus spreads rapidly through western Africa, with a confirmed case in its capital, Abuja, after a woman who arrived from Uganda tested positive for the virus. The woman began showing symptoms on 7 October and was admitted to a hospital in Abuja four days later, where she was later diagnosed with Ebola. It is unclear when she arrived in Nigeria, Africa’s most populous country.",
